### Register a grievance (replace citizenId with an existing citizen ID)
POST http://localhost:8082/api/grievances
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "citizenId": 1,
  "category": "WATER_SUPPLY",
  "severity": "HIGH",
  "title": "No water supply for two days",
  "description": "There has been no water supply in our street for two days.",
  "location": "Ward 12, Demo Nagar"
}

### List grievances
GET http://localhost:8082/api/grievances

### Dashboard summary
GET http://localhost:8082/api/dashboard/summary
